      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated veterinarians and support nurses"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend Dr Ashley Auerbach, Hannah, Taylor, and the nursing staff for their thoroughness and warm client care. Reviewers emphasize that the team listens attentively to health concerns and explains medical options with complete clarity. Clients frequently mention that staff greet both owners and animals warmly by name."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle treatment for family pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that clinicians and assistants treat dogs and cats with genuine affection and patience during examinations. Pet parents mention that nervous animals feel comfortable in the examination rooms and that owners can stay alongside them throughout care. Clients report smooth recoveries for pets treated for injuries, allergies, and routine check-ups."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and digital messaging"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight excellent communication regarding diagnosis, travel documentation, and post-consultation care plans. Pet parents appreciate that staff explain treatment rationales in plain language and provide timely updates through their mobile application. Reviewers note that questions submitted via the app receive prompt and helpful answers."
      }
    }
  ],
